data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":826,"item_id":"msg_02803aee6181feab016b0184cb3cac87d185e3e1d88c6838dd","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"{\"reviews\":[{\"actor\":\"lin\",\"decision\":\"develop\",\"ability\":null,\"reason\":\"No implemented interface restores lost health: eating restores satiety, rest restores energy, and existing warming or protection mechanisms only change exposure. Gradual recuperation is a reasonable missing physical mechanism. Lin has a real health deficit, but the reported temperature currently falls below the proposed recovery range; implementation supplies neither suitable conditions nor materials.\",\"specification\":\"Implement recuperate@1 through the current versioned handoff. Public interface recuperate: strict object schema {rounds: integer 1..12}, required rounds, no additional properties; prerequisites none; learning 3 rounds. Shared reference conventions remain unchanged; this self-targeted operation accepts no target or material references. State stores actor identity, operation ID, requested rounds, actual remaining rounds, paid rounds, cumulative healing and qualifying consecutive rounds. Each stationary round requires a living actor, health below 100, satiety >=40, energy >=4 and body temperature 16..22. Charge 0.5 energy and 0.2 satiety in addition to ordinary metabolism; recover up to 2 energy, capped at 40, instead of ordinary rest recovery. After normal environmental exposure and injury processing, heal min(0.25,100-health) only if those conditions still hold and no health damage occurred that round. Never prevent or offset same-round damage; failed eligibility cancels without healing that round. No material requirement, medicine claim, immunity or nutrition bonus. Use actual body temperature, hunger, fatigue and health, and existing shared room, collision and exposure geometry; merely naming a shelter has no effect. No new footprint or collision body is created. Complete after the requested paid rounds or upon reaching full health; publish actual healed amount and remaining work. Movement, changed action, lost eligibility or death cancels immediately; previously applied healing and paid costs remain, with no deferred healing. No escrow is created; cancellation must not alter unrelated escrow. Identical continuation preserves operation identity and remaining work; repeat starts complete operations, while global pauses preserve exact progress without time passing. Declare recuperation-started, recuperation-progress, recuperation-completed, recuperation-cancelled and recuperation-relief-qualified for validated subscriptions. Progress events include costs, before/after vitals, measured injury, healing and remaining work. Dependencies: existing vitals, metabolism, rest scheduling, exposure/damage ordering, event validation and wellbeing infrastructure. Add versioned operation state, public discovery/study metadata and memory/task adapters; migrate existing actors with no active recuperation or relief credit, preserving health and existing sources. Implementation and individual study are separate and neither advances time during this review.\",\"experienceReview\":\"Physical feedback comes from actual health recovery and its ordinary physical-wellbeing consequences, not an invented cure reward. Successful recuperation can also provide modest personal relief: after at least four consecutive eligible rounds in the same operation and at least 1 actual cumulative health restored without intervening damage, emit recuperation-relief-qualified for the performer once per operation. Register injury-recovery-relief: amount 0.5, cap 0.5, duration 6 rounds, cooldown 12 rounds; qualifying repetition refreshes rather than stacks. This source represents personally experienced recovery, not warmth, food, mastery or accumulated achievement; do not duplicate thermal-refuge or meal feedback. No separate maintained mental source is warranted for passive tissue repair: its lasting benefit is the actual retained health, while relief is transient. Application, learning, cancellation before qualification and unhealed waiting award nothing. Protected mental accounts and basic nutrition remain unchanged.\",\"visualReview\":\"Show a stationary resting posture and progress indicator bound to actual operation events, without creating furniture or implying unconsciousness. Display measured health changes, paid costs, remaining rounds and observable cancellation reasons. Replay uses recorded before/after vitals and event deltas, never re-applies healing. Completion may show a subdued recovery notice only when health actually increased; no instant-heal glow, fabricated supplies or shelter-protection overlay.\",\"learning\":3}]}","logprobs":[]}

